  "summary": {
    "text": "Gu Yue Mo Yan is a rank two Gu Master of the Gu Yue clan's Mo family on Qing Mao Mountain, sister of Gu Yue Mo Bei and granddaughter of elder Gu Yue Mo Chen, and one of the clan's early rising rank two figures.",
